831/641722788079865856603781.jpeg/U9DZKsw1-kem3C4gfXRJLIndOY7WGH3isdOyfrHTsn4\"/><figcaption>開學｜要讓小孩更專注，7種營養素不可少！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開學｜要讓小孩更專注，7種營養素不可少！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220831/641722790848237568675043.jpeg/b3f5PmXtHCdLnZpTyMIuRQM84gwFl9HB9fsiW_X7Ils\"/><figcaption>開學｜要讓小孩更專注，7種營養素不可少！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開學｜要讓小孩更專注，7種營養素不可少！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220831/641722793159430144539184.jpeg/bNT7Bpf_sT3ySIAqZRwLxfa3z9eZhp5NLmGMqy5hjKs\"/><figcaption>開學｜要讓小孩更專注，7種營養素不可少！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開學｜要讓小孩更專注，7種營養素不可少！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220831/641722795655172096451980.jpeg/pPb42KdrKwN4dgxDQFRrZgRWMLTLUFrFLFlh2SxZYdk\"/><figcaption>開學｜要讓小孩更專注，7種營養素不可少！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開學｜要讓小孩更專注，7種營養素不可少！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20220831/641722797727289344784639.jpeg/-vNvZ_FKJ_aY8zRrJ3dypLC3pTjw4DBBGGIzPBhiMzw\"/><figcaption>開學｜要讓小孩更專注，7種營養素不可少！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>開學前夕文具店擠爆！爸媽急排隊補貨 網笑「全台怨氣最重的地方」</p><p>開學直接當全校焦點！爸花一周打造「哪吒戰袍」 5歲兒秒變幼兒園人氣王</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T06:43:59.869642+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1941,"images":43,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}